    {
      "severity": "moderate",
      "description": "Emperor of Bones likely already has +1/+1 counters from a previous Adapt activation, meaning this Adapt 2 activation does nothing (Adapt only adds counters if the creature has none). Meanwhile, Ragavan is about to attack and could deal combat damage, generating value. Fatal Push cleanly kills Ragavan (mana value 1) before combat.",
