    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Fetched Meticulous Archive (enters tapped, surveil 1) instead of an untapped land. With Solitude and Ephemerate in hand, having untapped white mana available immediately could be relevant for casting Ephemerate or other instant-speed plays. The surveil 1 is marginal value compared to having mana available this turn.",
