    {
      "severity": "moderate",
      "description": "Cast Ephemerate on Ragavan postcombat, which has no ETB trigger and provides essentially zero value. This wastes a key white card that could have been exiled to evoke Solitude, which would remove Emperor of Bones (a significant threat) and gain 3 life from lifelink. The opponent is at 6 life and Emperor of Bones is a dangerous recursive threat.",
