    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Cast Fatal Push (an instant) during precombat main phase targeting a tapped Ragavan, when there's no benefit to doing so before combat. Emperor of Bones wants to attack and use its beginning-of-combat exile trigger. Fatal Push could be held until after combat or even until the opponent's turn for maximum flexibility and information.",
