      "severity": "moderate",
      "description": "MiMo Villain declined to cast Ephemerate in response to Fatal Push targeting Ragavan. Ephemerate would save Ragavan by exiling and returning it (causing Fatal Push to fizzle), preserving a 2/1 attacker against an opponent at 6 life. Ephemerate also has Rebound, providing additional value next turn (potentially blinking an evoked Solitude). Letting Ragavan die wastes both a creature and the opportunity to use Ephemerate's rebound.",
